{"id":"st2094-60","designation":"ST 2094-60","title":"Dynamic Metadata for Color Volume Transform — Application #6","state":"active","suite":"2094","official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st2094-60/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st2094-60/","checked_at":"2026-11-18"},"scope":"This document specifies the color volume transform metadata items for Application #6, a specialized model of the generalized color volume transform defined by the core components document SMPTE ST 2094-1. This color volume transform is based on five anchor points. The metadata set characterizes HDR-SDR conversions within the mastering process. SMPTE ST 2094-60:2025 © SMPTE 2025 – All Rights Reserved","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"Foreword","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"Intellectual Property","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"Introduction","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"2 Conformance","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"3 Normative References","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"4 Terms and Definitions","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.1 HDR-SDR anchor","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.2 Narrow Range","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.3 Full Range","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.4 Extended Range","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.5 Nominal Range","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.6 Y Black Level","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.7 Y Nominal Peak","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.8 Y′ Black Level","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.9 Y′ Nominal Peak","page":5},{"level":1,"title":"5 Application Identification","page":5},{"level":1,"title":"6 Color Volume Transform","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"6.1 HDR Transfer Function","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"6.2 HDR Nominal Range","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"6.3 Nominal Range Anchors","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"6.3.1 Introduction","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"6.3.2 DiffuseWhiteAnchor","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"6.3.3 ReferenceLevelAnchor","page":7},{"level":3,"title":"6.3.4 SDRNominalRangeMaxAnchor","page":7},